# --- Dated backup snapshots created during iterative editing ---------------
# This project's actual version history lives in `diario_pesquisa.md` and
# `ANALISE_E_PLANO_EJOR.md` (a detailed research diary predating git in this
# project) and, from now on, in git itself. The dated "*_backup_*" /
# "*_pre_..._backup*" copies scattered across the tree were a manual
# substitute for version control and are now redundant with git history.
*_backup_*.py
*_backup_*.tex
*_backup_*.bib
*_backup_*.md
*_backup_*.csv
*_backup_*.txt
*pre_*backup*.py
*pre_*backup*.tex
*pre_*backup*.bib
*pre_*backup*.md
*pre_*backup*.csv
*pre_*backup*.txt

# --- Diary-append working files ---------------------------------------------
# Each diary entry (Entrada N) was appended via a small trio of files
# (entradaN_text.md, notaN_text.txt, append_entradaN.py). Their content is
# already inside diario_pesquisa.md / ANALISE_E_PLANO_EJOR.md, so keeping
# ~90 sets of these separately would just duplicate the record.
entrada*_text.md
entrada*_text_tmp.md
nota*_text.txt
nota*_text_tmp.txt
append_entrada*.py

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# --- LaTeX build artifacts ---------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated from paper/learnheuristic_pmsp.tex + paper/refs.bib by
# xelatex/bibtex; only the sources and the figures they include are tracked.
paper/*.aux
paper/*.bbl
paper/*.blg
paper/*.log
paper/*.out
paper/*.synctex.gz
paper/*.spl
paper/*.pdf

# --- Scratch / intermediate files not part of the reported results ---------
_scratch_*
*_tmp.*
*.log

# --- Explicitly superseded/deprecated material ------------------------------
archive/
_to_delete/

# --- Third-party public benchmark (Ostojic et al., 2025) -------------------
# Redistributing the raw dataset here would just duplicate someone else's
# data. See external_benchmarks/pcmax_symmetry2025/README.md for the
# canonical download URL; loader.py reads directly from the downloaded
# .zip files, and manifest.csv (tracked) records exactly which instances
# this study sampled. Results_iAF.xlsx is the source's own reference
# solutions file, also third-party and re-downloadable from the same place.
external_benchmarks/pcmax_symmetry2025/*.zip
external_benchmarks/pcmax_symmetry2025/extracted/
external_benchmarks/pcmax_symmetry2025/Results_iAF.xlsx

# --- Reference material supplied for formatting guidance, not this
# project's own output (possibly copyrighted third-party papers). ----------
Artigos EJOR - Exemplo/

